iff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100234.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds a right click menu option to the script editor's file list to view owners of the script. It works the same way that it does in the FileSystem area.\r\n\r\nThis would close proposals: [#1487](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1487) and [#11010](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11010)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"338\" alt=\"View owners menu option\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41b434d3-ed59-4ce0-83b3-75c36c544d98\">\r\n\r\nI believe this is a minor QOL improvement being able to go directly from the file in the editor to the scene which utilizes it. Without this change, we have to go from File editor -> File System -> scene.\r\n\r\nThis is my first github and godot pull request. I tried my best to follow the contributing guidelines, but if I have missed something, please let me know!\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1487*\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11010*","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100234/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}